<title>SPAIN: Repsol plans YPF stake buy - press.</title>
<headline>Repsol plans YPF stake buy - press.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish energy group Repsol is interested in buying a stake in Argentine oil giant Yacimentos Petroliferos Fiscales, Chairman Alfonso Cortina told Argentine President Carlos Menem, newspapers reported on Thursday.</p>
<p>No-one at Repsol was available for comment.</p>
<p>According to financial daily Expansion, Repsol is aiming to take a stake of up to 10 percent in the firm, valued at around 100 billion pesetas.</p>
<p>Cortina said on Wednesday that Repsol will invest $2 billion in Argentina over the next four years, according to Argentine state news agency Telam.</p>
<p>-- Madrid newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
